<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <PackageId>Ozakboy.TradeKit.Binance</PackageId>
    <AssemblyName>Ozakboy.TradeKit.Binance</AssemblyName>
    <RootNamespace>Ozakboy.TradeKit.Binance</RootNamespace>

    <Title>Ozakboy.TradeKit.Binance — 幣安 USDⓈ-M 永續合約交易所實作</Title>
    <Description>Ozakboy.TradeKit.Abstractions 的幣安 USDⓈ-M 永續合約實作,建構在 Ozakboy.Http 的簽章／限流／重試管線之上,不使用任何第三方社群套件。本版提供交易規則(exchangeInfo 的 PRICE_FILTER / LOT_SIZE / MIN_NOTIONAL / MARKET_LOT_SIZE)對映與每日快照快取、伺服器時間、帳戶與持倉查詢,以及下單、撤單、查單與槓桿／保證金模式設定(下單一律不可重試,並以 clientOrderId 作為冪等識別碼),再加上幣安錯誤碼到交易所中立錯誤碼的完整對映(時間戳偏移、簽章無效、IP 白名單、保證金不足、限流各自可辨識)。REST 與 WebSocket 端點以「環境」成組提供,杜絕主網與 Testnet 混接;交易規則快取以環境為鍵,避免 Testnet 的步進值被誤用到主網。行情方面提供歷史 K 線查詢,以及 WebSocket 的 K 線與標記價訂閱(連線管理、重連與重連後重放訂閱取自 Ozakboy.WebSockets);K 線的「是否已收盤」逐筆正確對映,REST 回應沒有這個旗標的部分則以收盤時間推得,策略不會拿到未收盤的 K 線當成收盤資料。條件單(停損、停利、移動停損)走幣安 2025-12-09 起啟用的 Algo Order 端點,與一般委託分成兩條路徑:送單同樣絕不重試,clientAlgoId 失敗時也帶得回來,狀態變化由使用者資料串流的 ALGO_UPDATE 事件送出,而一般的掛單查詢、委託串流與撤銷全部掛單都看不到條件單,緊急出場必須兩邊都撤。使用者資料串流提供委託、條件單、成交、帳戶增量、保證金追繳與對帳訊號六種訂閱:單一連線內部分流,listenKey 自動建立／續期／重建／刪除,以 LIST_SUBSCRIPTIONS 心跳做閒置偵測;跟不上的訂閱者以失敗結束而不靜默丟棄事件,串流憑證不進任何錯誤與日誌,並在取得當下登記成遮罩器的已知祕密,連本套件管不到的路徑流出的那一份也會被換成遮罩字串。憑證的續期成功、續期失敗與失效都有日誌與計數(日誌一律不含憑證),次數與時刻另以 ListenKeyStatus 快照公開給健康度呈現,續期失敗會以短退避重試而不是空等下一個排程。A Binance USDⓈ-M perpetual futures implementation of Ozakboy.TradeKit.Abstractions, built on the Ozakboy.Http signing, rate-limiting, and retry pipeline with no third-party dependencies. This release covers exchange-info trading rules with a per-environment daily cache, server time, account and position queries, order placement, cancellation and lookup, leverage and margin mode, and a full Binance-to-neutral error code mapping. Order placement is never retried and carries a clientOrderId as its idempotency key. Market data covers historical klines plus WebSocket kline and mark price subscriptions, with the candle closed flag mapped from the stream and derived from the close time on REST, never assumed. Conditional orders (stop, take-profit, trailing) use the Algo Order endpoints Binance switched to on 2025-12-09 and form a path of their own: placement is never retried, the clientAlgoId comes back even on failure, state changes arrive on the user data stream as ALGO_UPDATE, and the ordinary open-orders query, order stream, and cancel-all never see them, so an emergency exit has to clear both sides. The user data stream covers order updates, conditional order updates, fills, account deltas, margin calls, and resync signals over one fanned-out connection, with a fully managed listenKey and heartbeat-based idle detection; a subscriber that falls behind ends with a failure instead of silently losing events, and the stream credential never reaches an error or a log and is registered as a known secret on the client masker the moment it is obtained, so even a copy leaving by a route this package does not control comes out masked. Credential renewals, their failures, and an expiry are logged and counted without the credential ever appearing in a line, the counts and instants are exposed as a ListenKeyStatus snapshot for health display, and a failed renewal is retried after a short backoff rather than waiting out the next scheduled attempt.</Description>
    <PackageTags>ozakboy;tradekit;binance;binance-futures;usds-m;perpetual;futures;exchange;trading;exchangeinfo;tick-size;step-size;min-notional;order;idempotency;client-order-id;no-retry;websocket;market-data;kline;candlestick;mark-price;streaming;user-data-stream;listen-key;order-updates;account-updates;margin-call;hmac-sha256;rate-limit;testnet;result-type;decimal;dotnet;csharp</PackageTags>

    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/ozakboy/Ozakboy.TradeKit.Binance</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/ozakboy/Ozakboy.TradeKit.Binance</RepositoryUrl>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>0.3.0 — Account snapshots now carry the maintenance and initial margin. GetAccountSnapshotAsync fills AccountSnapshot.TotalMaintenanceMargin and TotalInitialMargin from the top-level totalMaintMargin and totalInitialMargin of /fapi/v2/account, and each Balance's MaintenanceMargin and InitialMargin from assets[].maintMargin and initialMargin, with no extra endpoint and no change in weight. A margin ratio needs the maintenance margin; using the much larger initial margin instead understated the ratio and blocked orders too early. A missing or unreadable field maps to null (unknown) and the snapshot still parses, while "0.00000000" is a stated zero and reads as 0 — a gap is never filled with zero, because zero reads as no liquidation risk. Balance.MarginBalance stays the computed WalletBalance + UnrealizedPnl. The dependency moves to Ozakboy.TradeKit.Abstractions 0.5.0, which only adds properties defaulting to null. 0.2.1 — Moves to Ozakboy.Http 0.3.3. No code in this package changed and the public API is the same. Before Ozakboy.Http 0.3.3 only the signing handler wrote WithQueryParameters into the request URI, and AddOzakboyHttpPipeline does not attach it when EnableSigning = false, so a caller that built its own credential-free, signing-off REST client and handed it to BinanceMarketDataFeed sent GetKlinesAsync without symbol, interval or limit, and Binance answered -1102. AddBinanceFutures always signs and was never affected. A MainnetPublic test now fetches klines from mainnet public endpoints through exactly such a pipeline, and an offline test asserts the parameters go out in order; both were red on Ozakboy.Http 0.3.2 and are green on 0.3.3. 0.2.0 — Conditional orders now go through the Algo Order endpoints; PlaceOrderAsync sends a conditional type only to have the exchange reject it. Binance moved STOP_MARKET, TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET, STOP, TAKE_PROFIT and TRAILING_STOP_MARKET to the Algo Service on 2025-12-09, and POST /fapi/v1/order answers -4120 for every one of them. BinanceFuturesClient gains PlaceConditionalOrderAsync, CancelConditionalOrderAsync, GetConditionalOrderAsync, GetOpenConditionalOrdersAsync and CancelAllConditionalOrdersAsync; placement is never retried, exactly as for an ordinary order, and clientAlgoId comes back on failure so a timed-out stop can still be found. BinanceUserDataFeed gains SubscribeConditionalOrderUpdatesAsync, fed by the new ALGO_UPDATE event whose name is added to the events filter used when dialling. Three silent consequences: GetOpenOrdersAsync does not list conditional orders, SubscribeOrderUpdatesAsync does not carry them, and CancelAllOrdersAsync does not cancel them, so an emergency exit must call both cancel-all methods. A conditional order is not margin-checked before it triggers and an untriggered one cannot be modified. BinanceFuturesClient also gains GetUserTradesAsync (GET /fapi/v1/userTrades, weight 5) for the reconciliation sweep: the fill stream drops and nothing else backfills what was missed, so the engine re-queries from the timestamp of its last known fill. Since and fromId are mutually exclusive because Binance does not accept startTime alongside fromId, a limit above 1000 is refused rather than clamped, and a fill missing its timestamp or id — or carrying a commission with no commissionAsset — fails the parse instead of receiving a default. Sweeps always overlap, so callers de-duplicate on Trade.TradeId. Breaking: the dependency moves to Ozakboy.TradeKit.Abstractions 0.4.0, which adds conditional members to IExchangeClient and IUserDataFeed. Full notes: https://github.com/ozakboy/Ozakboy.TradeKit.Binance/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md</PackageReleaseNotes>

    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <!--
    這兩個命名空間幾乎每個檔案都用到(Result/Error 與全部交易模型),集中宣告成隱含 using,
    避免每個檔案開頭重複四行,也避免 XML 註解裡的 cref 反過來讓 IDE0005 判成未使用的 using。
    Both namespaces are used by almost every file, so they are declared once as implicit usings.
  -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <Using Include="Ozakboy.Core.Abstractions" />
    <Using Include="Ozakboy.TradeKit.Abstractions" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <!-- 內部解析輔助型別需要直接測試,它們不屬於公開契約。 -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <InternalsVisibleTo Include="Ozakboy.TradeKit.Binance.Tests" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\..\LICENSE" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
    <None Include="..\..\README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
    <None Include="..\..\logo.png" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <!--
    相依政策:只允許 .NET BCL、Microsoft 官方套件與 Ozakboy.* 自研套件,判定看「遞移相依」而非套件名稱。
    這正是本套件存在的理由 —— 幣安的第三方社群套件(Binance.Net 等)一律不使用。
    Ozakboy.Core.Abstractions 仍然明確指定 0.3.0。TradeKit.Abstractions 0.2.0 起遞移帶的已經就是 0.3.0,
    但明寫的成本是一行、拿掉的代價是下次上游降版時無聲還原到舊版,所以留著。
    Dependency policy: only the .NET BCL, first-party Microsoft packages, and Ozakboy.* packages, judged by the
    transitive graph rather than by package name — which is the whole reason this package exists instead of a
    community Binance client. Ozakboy.Core.Abstractions stays pinned even though TradeKit.Abstractions 0.2.0
    already carries 0.3.0 transitively: the pin costs one line and removing it would let a future upstream
    downgrade restore an older version in silence.
  -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Ozakboy.TradeKit.Abstractions" Version="0.5.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="Ozakboy.Http" Version="0.3.3" />
    <PackageReference Include="Ozakboy.Core.Abstractions" Version="0.3.0" />
    <!--
      0.1.3 起 SecretMasker 進了公開 API(BinanceUserDataFeed 接受遮罩器的那個建構式多載),
      所以明寫這一行,不靠 Ozakboy.Http 遞移帶進來:公開契約上的型別來自遞移相依,
      上游哪天不再帶它,斷的是本套件的編譯而不是上游的。版號與 Ozakboy.Http 0.3.3 帶的那一份相同。
      Since 0.1.3 SecretMasker is part of the public API — the BinanceUserDataFeed overload that takes a masker —
      so it is referenced directly instead of arriving transitively through Ozakboy.Http: a type on the public
      contract that comes from a transitive dependency breaks this package's build, not upstream's, the day
      upstream stops carrying it. The version matches the one Ozakboy.Http 0.3.3 brings.
    -->
    <PackageReference Include="Ozakboy.Security" Version="0.1.1" />
    <!--
      行情串流的連線管理(重連、重連後重放訂閱、閒置逾時存活偵測、有界佇列背壓)一律用這個套件,
      本套件不自己實作。它的遞移相依只有 Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Abstractions 與
      Ozakboy.Core.Abstractions 0.3.0(與上面那一行同版),整棵樹仍然沒有任何第三方社群套件。
      All market stream connection management — reconnection, subscription replay, idle-timeout liveness, and
      bounded-queue backpressure — comes from this package rather than being reimplemented here. It brings in
      only Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Abstractions and the same Ozakboy.Core.Abstractions 0.3.0 pinned above,
      so the transitive graph still contains no community package.
    -->
    <PackageReference Include="Ozakboy.WebSockets" Version="0.2.1" />
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.Abstractions" Version="10.0.12" />
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Http" Version="10.0.12" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <!--
    刻意不引用 Microsoft.SourceLink.GitHub 套件,與其他 Ozakboy.* 套件一致。
    自 .NET 8 起 SourceLink 已內建於 SDK,設定 PublishRepositoryUrl 與 EmbedUntrackedSources
    (見 Directory.Build.props)即可;外掛套件反而會帶進有安全通報的相依,
    在 TreatWarningsAsErrors 之下讓「還原」階段就直接失敗。
  -->

</Project>
